Architecture parity:
  - Data sources useVehicles/useVehicleState/useSecurityLatest/useChargingTelemetryLatest are
    bound through the P1/S8 state-holder layer: the View owns @Observable DigitalTwinMiniModel
    which projects into the shared-facade LoadableState; data arrives via the injected
    DigitalTwinMiniDataSource seam (AppContainer-wired in production). NO HTTP in the View.
  - Every web t() key is reproduced via the P1/S10 xcstrings catalog; no English literals in code.
  - States reproduced: loading (skeleton) / empty ("No vehicle data") / error (TSQueryError +
    retry) / stale (freshness chip + refresh) / offline (cached + offline chip) / content.
  - Diagnostics: model emits view.opened with surface slug "DigitalTwinMiniWidget" once on appear
    (P1/S11), via an injectable @Sendable seam (osLog default).
  - Accessibility: header isHeader trait; glyph combined VoiceOver label (lock/sentry/charge/
    openings); badges combined labels; refresh + open labelled; reduce-motion honored on glow.

